  <trk>
    <name>The Leukerbad via ferrata on the Daubenhorn</name>
    <desc>The Leukerbad via ferrata leads through the southeast escarpments of the Daubenhorn and is the longest via ferrata in Switzerland. Besides several ladders, climbers even encounter a cave that must be traversed!</desc>
    <type>viaferrata</type>
